    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d700-a4">

                <pb facs="0814" n="808" sameAs="frus:frus1942v03/pg808"/>

                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <date calendar="gregorian" when="1942-06-06">
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">June</hi> 6</date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>In Bosnia, mountain of Majovica, my detachments have beaten the ustashis and
                    captured four guns. The ustashis have fled towards Serbia but they have been
                    supported by the Germans. In the region of Bosnia the action of chetniks is
                    going on. Hercegovina is now, unfortunately, subjected to a Communistic terror.
                    It seems that all our provinces have to go through this terror which brings the
                    revolt and finally the liberation. You may be sure that we will be united for
                    the final hour but we need arms and munition.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Mihajlović</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
                <postscript>
                    <p>[Other telegrams, not printed, related to matters other than Communist
                        activities.]</p>
                </postscript>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
